k-pack.ts`, `scripts/check-release.ts`,\n997-  `scripts/platforms.ts`, `scripts/release.ts`, `scripts/version.ts`,\n998-  `scripts/licenses.sh`, `scripts/licenses_test.go`\n999-- `src/launcher.ts`\n1000-- `test/check-pack.test.ts`, `test/launcher.test.ts`,\n1001-  `test/manifest.test.ts`, `test/prepublish.test.ts`,\n1002-  `test/release.test.ts`, `test/version.test.ts`,\n1003-  `test/release-fixture.ts`\n1004-- `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, `.github/tools/*`\n1005-- `internal/buildinfo/buildinfo.go`, `internal/buildinfo/buildinfo_test.go`\n1006-- `internal/config/schema_test.go` (`TestSchemaMatchesConfigStruct`)\n1007-- `internal/cli/init_test.go`\n1008-  (`TestInitSchemaPointsIntoTheInstalledPackage`)\n1009-- `internal/prompts/prompts.go`, `internal/skill/skill.go`,\n1010-  `internal/gate/gate.go` (`//go:embed` assets)\n1176:Differential harness: compare `meta.json`, decompressed `.gz` artifacts,\n1177-`provider-responses.jsonl`, `findings.jsonl` (ignoring `ts`), index lines\n1178-(ignoring `ts`), and the decompressed bundle tar's entry list and\n1179-manifest, after normalizing run IDs, timestamps, and digests that\n1180-include them.\n1181-\n1182-## 6. Go baseline references\n1183-\n1184-At commit `cd08f10`:\n1185-\n1186-- `internal/record/record.go` -- DefaultDir, run ID, report, finding\n1187-  spill, monthly index, SeenBefore.\n1188-- `internal/record/meta.go` -- Meta shape, RunDir, meta/artifact\n1189-  read/write, RemoveRun, CaptureEnv, Digest.\n1190-- `internal/record/files.go` -- StateDir, ensureDir, makeRunDir, private\n1191-  file helpers.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01HFTG4Mf4d1eE2p17bzMC7Y","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
